    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 14 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998, I, the undersigned, hereby de-clare my determination as set out in the Schedule appended hereto in regard to the title to parcel of Land No. 202 of Block 01 contained in the Cadastral Map No. 510820, situated in the Village of Suriyapaluwa, within the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 245 B - Suriya-paluwa in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Mahara, in the District of Gampaha, in the Province of Western, referred to in Notice calling for claims to land parcels which was duly published in the Gazette No. 2077/18 of 26th June, 2018 in terms of Section 55 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998. K.A.K. RANJITH DHARMAPALA, Commissioner of Title Settlement. Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 25th October, 2018",
